2. Do not let the client determine mining, settlement, ledger or balance values.
3. Use server time for trial/mining/event/rule calculations.
4. Do not write mining progress every second.
5. Trial ledger and real wallet ledger are separate.
6. Asset mutations must be ledger-first and idempotent.
7. Economic rules are versioned with effective timestamps.
8. AI cannot directly mutate balances, approve funding/withdrawals or determine mining rewards.
9. User-facing UI is Korean-first and must remain simple enough for broad age ranges.
10. Premium quality is required: polished loading/empty/error states, responsive behavior, accessibility and restrained motion.
11. New features must identify their owning domain, audit impact, analytics impact and admin controls before implementation.
